INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `RewardText`)
VALUES
(55100, 'The eternal flame recognizes a kindred spirit in you, $N.$B$BFire is sacred to the Tauren - from our ceremonial flames to An''she himself. As a Pyromancer, you will wield flame in all its forms. You will conjure fire that burns underwater, create explosions that level fortresses, and rain meteors from clear skies.$B$BYour flames will burn with purpose and discrimination. You will understand fire''s dual nature - destruction and creation, chaos and renewal. Master the Fireball, learn the Pyroblast, and eventually command the Phoenix itself.$B$BWelcome to the inferno''s heart. Let your flames reshape the world!'),
(55101, 'You have heard the whispers from beyond, $N. Not all Tauren would dare this path.$B$BThe void offers power that predates the Earthmother, knowledge from before creation itself. As a Cultist, you will channel madness into magic, see truth in chaos, and commune with entities that should not exist. The Old Gods'' influence seeps through reality''s cracks.$B$BYou will master Void Bolt, learn to spread Madness, and open rifts to dimensions beyond comprehension. Your sanity will be constantly tested, but in return, you gain power that transcends mortal limits.$B$BWelcome to the void''s embrace. Let reality bend to your will!'),
(55102, 'The stars have chosen you, $N. Mu''sha and An''she are but the beginning.$B$BAs a Starcaller, you draw power from celestial bodies - stars, moons, comets, and cosmic phenomena beyond mortal sight. The night sky becomes your grimoire, constellations your spells. You will channel starlight into devastating beams, call down meteor showers, and navigate by stellar winds.$B$BThe Tauren have always watched the sky for omens. You go further - you command the very stars themselves. Master Starfall, learn Celestial Alignment, and eventually summon the power of distant galaxies.$B$BWelcome to cosmic mastery. Let the universe itself answer your call!'),
(55103, 'An''she''s blessing shines upon you, $N.$B$BThe Sunwalkers have rediscovered ancient ways. As a Sun Cleric, you channel divine solar radiance to heal wounds, cure diseases, and burn away corruption. You become a beacon of hope in darkness, wielding An''she''s power for protection and justice.$B$BYou will learn Solar Beam to sear enemies, Healing Light to mend allies, and Sun''s Blessing to inspire hope. The undead flee your presence, shadows retreat from your light.$B$BWelcome to radiant service. Let your light pierce all darkness!'),
(55104, 'The ancient runes respond to your presence, $N.$B$BLong before shamanism or druidism, the Tauren carved runes. These symbols predate language - they are pure concept given form. As a Runemaster, each inscription you create channels specific powers that persist long after other magics fade.$B$BYou will learn Protection Runes for defense, Power Runes to enhance weapons, and Binding Runes to trap enemies. Precision is everything - one misplaced line changes everything. Your marks will endure for millennia.$B$BWelcome to eternal inscription. Let your runes reshape reality!'),
(55105, 'The elements recognize their master in you, $N.$B$BUnlike shamans who negotiate with elements, primalists command through raw will. Earth, fire, water, air all bend to your desires without question. You don''t ask permission; you take control. This power comes from understanding the primal forces that shaped our world.$B$BYou will summon the very fury of the elements, command them to do your bidding, and eventually become one with the elements themselves. The earth trembles at your approach, flames leap to serve you, storms gather at your call.$B$BWelcome to elemental dominion. Let the primal forces obey!'),
(55106, 'You stand ready to become the shield, $N.$B$BThe guardian embodies the great mesas that protect our homeland. As a Guardian, you channel the Earthmother''s protective embrace, standing between danger and the innocent. You will learn Stone Skin to become granite, Earth Shield to protect allies, and Stand as Mountain to become immovable.$B$BThis path demands sacrifice. You endure pain meant for others. But there is no greater honor than being the shield that never breaks, the wall that never falls. The Tauren have always been protectors.$B$BWelcome to eternal vigilance. Let evil shatter upon your defenses!'),
(55107, 'Thunder greets you as kin, $N.$B$BThe Tauren have always respected storms. As a Stormbringer, you don''t merely respect them - you become them. Thunder is your voice, lightning your weapon, winds your servants. You will master Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, and Storm Form itself.$B$BThe very air crackles with your presence. Clouds gather at your approach. You are the tempest incarnate, channeling nature''s fury through mortal form. This power demands control - an uncontrolled storm destroys all.$B$BWelcome to the tempest''s heart. Let thunder herald your coming!'),
(55108, 'The Earthmother has guided you to the path of rage, $N.$B$BThe berserker''s fury flows through Tauren blood like rivers through plains. Our ancestors channeled this rage to protect our people from centaurs, quilboar, and worse. As a Barbarian, you harness this fury - controlled, focused, devastating.$B$BYou will master the power of the ancestors for strength, embrace your brutality, and learn to become a hunter of the most savage degree. Your rage becomes a living force, growing with each battle. The path demands control - ride the storm without being consumed.$B$BWelcome to eternal fury. Let the plains tremble at your war cry!'),
(55109, 'Your commitment to justice has brought you here, $N.$B$BThe templar combines warrior strength with spiritual power. You become justice incarnate, every action blessed by the Earthmother, every strike carrying divine judgment. You will master Holy Strike, Divine Shield, and Consecration itself.$B$BThe Tauren have always fought for what is right. As a Templar, you become the ultimate expression of these values. Your presence weakens evil and strengthens good, tipping any battle''s scales toward righteousness.$B$BWelcome to sacred service. Let justice guide your every action!'),
(55110, 'The hunt has called you home, $N.$B$BThe Tauren have always lived in harmony with nature, but Rangers go deeper. You become one with the wild, understanding beast language, tracking invisible trails, surviving where others perish. You will tame kodos and plainstriders, master the bow, and read the land itself.$B$BOur people need rangers more than ever. The Barrens grow dangerous, corruptions spread, enemies stir. You are our eyes in the wild, our first warning, our swift response. No quarry will escape your pursuit.$B$BWelcome to the eternal hunt. Let no enemy escape your sight!'),
(200108, ''),
(200076, ''),
(200137, ''),
(200138, ''),
(200139, ''),
(200163, 'Aha! You have shown me that you are truly powerful. For this, I reward you with a symbol of the Bear itself. May it guide you on your journeys and give you strength over your foes.'),
(200146, ''),
(200014, 'This seems to be the falcon in question, and it seems injured.'),
(200015, 'The falcon seems distraught. It must have been the suspicious creature who attacked it!'),
(200016, 'Thank you for finding Keed. He has already returned to me, healthy as ever.$B$BI''ve already sent him on yet another scouting mission.$B$B... you''re saying a strange creature was seen near Keed and that it attacked you? That must have been the creature that injured my boy.$B$BI''ll have to look into this more. Based on your description, whatever this is, it''s not native to Mulgore.'),
(200032, 'Mu''sha''s grace radiates from you, $N. The moon is pleased.$B$BI have two weapons for you to choose from, blessed by Mu''sha.$B$BGo forth as Mu''sha''s Chosen. We will meet again.'),
(200101, ''),
(200102, ''),
(200103, ''),
(200064, 'One good deed deserves another, $N.'),
(200082, '');
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `CompletionText`)
VALUES
(55100, 'Fire dances in your eyes, $N. Have you brought the Seared Tome? The eternal flame beckons.'),
(55101, 'The void whispers your name, $N. Have you brought the Void Manuscript? Ancient powers stir.'),
(55102, 'The stars align for you, $N. Have you brought the Celestial Chart? Cosmic power awaits.'),
(55103, 'An''she''s light shines upon you, $N. Have you brought the Sun Prayer? Divine radiance awaits.'),
(55104, 'Runic power emanates from you, $N. Have you brought the Tauren Rune Stone? Ancient inscriptions await.'),
(55105, 'The elements surge around you, $N. Have you brought the Elemental Totem? Raw power awaits.'),
(55106, 'The Earthmother guides your steps, $N. Have you brought the Earth Shield Tablet? The guardian''s duty calls.'),
(55107, 'Thunder echoes your steps, $N. Have you brought the Thunder Call? The storm gathers.'),
(55108, 'The ancestors speak of your approach, $N. Have you brought the Ancestral War Tablet? The path of fury awaits.'),
(55109, 'Your oath has weight, $N. Have you brought the Sacred Oath? Justice calls.'),
(55110, 'The wild calls to you, $N. Have you brought the Plains Hunter Guide? The eternal hunt awaits.'),
(200108, ''),
(200076, ''),
(200137, ''),
(200138, ''),
(200139, ''),
(200163, 'Have you laid waste to the quilboars, $N?'),
(200146, ''),
(200014, ''),
(200015, ''),
(200016, 'You have not failed me, nor have you failed Keed. Thank you, $N.'),
(200032, ''),
(200101, ''),
(200102, ''),
(200103, ''),
(200064, 'Have you had any luck finding the pendant, $N?'),
(200082, '');
